{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nWorkflow runs from `gh run list --json`.\n\n## Spec\n- Columns: status icon (queued / in progress / success / failure / cancelled), workflow name, run number, branch, event, elapsed / duration, relative time\n- While any run is in progress, refresh on a tick (same mechanism as PR Checks watch mode)\n- `/` search over workflow / branch; `o` opens the run in the browser\n- Selection drives the jobs pane\n\nPart of #98.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:42Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":100,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Actions: runs pane"}
